{"time": 1756683533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831866455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你注意到，在这片尽头构成的白光之下，似乎是一个镜面。"}
