{"time": 1756780575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182539459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "西里斯皱着眉说话，“艾络温小姐的话确实有些道理...但假设...我们从来没有离开过中环呢？”"}
{"time": 1756780598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1785688088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，不是说骑士团在外环）"}
