{"time": 1756901042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003957438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（所以我总觉得这里的事她不会知道）"}
{"time": 1756901450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619036140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐真好... 那姐姐可以给我讲讲我们之间的事情吗”"}
{"time": 1756901476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "437986717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1869199216]\"诶...?\"她的手停在你的脸上，你感觉有些暖暖的，\"伊芙...不喜欢吗？\""}
{"time": 1756901886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1279687256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=437986717]“不要……不要安息……”*抓着她的手一点点推开“我为恨而死……要为爱而死……不可以舍弃……”"}
{"time": 1756902516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904403160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1619036140]（"}
{"time": 1756902630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271273578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1619036140]\"不可以哦～这是独属于我的故事，小诺诺要一点一点自己去发掘呢～\"她伸出手点点你的鼻尖，\"我只是太着急了，生怕小诺诺讨厌我呢～\""}
{"time": 1756902752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1311803533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1279687256]\"这样啊，妃花可以理解....\"她的手从脸颊转移到你的眼睛前把你的视野全部遮住，\"并非安眠，而是独属于妃花的安息...以绝对的善对待世界，伊芙不想接受吗？\"你感觉思维回温，不再是之前那种混沌难明的状态"}
{"time": 1756902776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1163302084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我怎么会讨厌姐姐呢....”"}
{"time": 1756902863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1212600491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我喜欢姐姐就像喜欢师父和露露那样...”"}
{"time": 1756903024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1770980875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1311803533]“不可以……我做过的事，都会找上来……我只能狂奔，把他们都甩在后面”*固执地要挪开她的手“……不是放下屠刀就能成圣的”"}
{"time": 1756903687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762304298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1212600491]\"那就好，突然出现在小诺诺的梦里，是不是有点冒昧啦？\"她俏皮地吐吐舌头，双手背在身后"}
{"time": 1756903743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "861065213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1770980875]\"不冲突吧？\"她的手被你拨开一些，\"你做的那些事情...会有人替你原谅，伊芙...只需要安息就好。\""}
{"time": 1756903872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261772", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没有啦...能见到姐姐我已经很开心了，算是这两天唯一的好事吧”叹口气"}
{"time": 1756904137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956168282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=861065213]“……不要再说了。安息的伊芙……那不是我”*直起身来“我的爱……很少，所以才不允许……什么人都来分点走”"}
{"time": 1756904431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699879361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=762304298]“能见到姐姐我就已经很开心了，这应该是这两天少有的好事了 ”叹口气"}
