{"time": 1756988625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140825955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1022035962]眼睛闪烁着冰蓝色的光芒，显示的答案是...普通人，“哦呀？伊芙小姐这是在？”她眯着一只眼睛，另外半边看着你，“做什么呢？”"}
{"time": 1756988814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "437107420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……没什么”*拿着衣服“这里有换衣间的吧”"}
{"time": 1756989646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1552018364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=437107420]“没有，你要是想换可以去里间的洗手间。”"}
{"time": 1756989742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2103301449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1455893886]\"...\"她伸手摸摸你的脑袋，\"别担心...只要...不轻易死亡，她不能怎么样你。\""}
{"time": 1756989904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764342728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1552018364]“行吧”*兴致缺缺，但是拿着衣服去里间的洗手间"}
{"time": 1756989922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "202414697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...但要是她能进到梦里把我杀了，我该怎么办”"}
{"time": 1756990148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979915924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"梦是你的主场。\"西里斯揉揉你的头发，你感觉...内心轻松了许多，\"只要你不想，她杀不了你。\""}
