{"time": 1757046502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964992693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=897559974]\"一开始就没有被卷进来吧。\""}
{"time": 1757046546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091262319", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这是可以通关幻术实现的吗...”"}
{"time": 1757046555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "198850641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这是可以通过幻术实现的吗...”"}
{"time": 1757046877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867790061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"幻术的本质是人的精神。\"她摆出一副说教的样子，\"只要理解了这一点，就会想明白了吧？\""}
{"time": 1757047021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532751335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，所以中环被分割的原理其实是所有人的精神被分割出去了？然后这里是个类似幻境的地方..”大胆提出猜想"}
{"time": 1757047355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1038112170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"也许...\"她可能是这个想法，但并不能严格确定如此，只能给你一个模棱两可的答案"}
{"time": 1757047621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599616156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是这下就麻烦了....西莉斯姐姐，用那个徽章也不能进学校吗”"}
{"time": 1757047821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "235720803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"本来就只是用来进内外门的东西啦。不过现在是非常时期，倒也不是不能去看看?\""}
{"time": 1757047856, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1245318916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"谢谢西莉斯姐姐，那我们走吧\""}
{"time": 1757047871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811710004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去学院！"}
{"time": 1757048213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1740124929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "天色已经完全黯淡，路上的街灯亮起。到达学院...这里几乎没有看见任何人，虽然就在热闹的广场上，但在学院这一侧，全然没有一丝生气。学院大门的能量流在其上翻腾不已，一副生人勿近的样子。"}
{"time": 1757048216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "613367148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "过一个幸运"}
{"time": 1757048241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "284241004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+1 幸运"}
