{"time": 1757048247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1070794324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（经典出目）"}
{"time": 1757048458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81555483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“学院的学生看样子没有被分割进来？往好处想，她不管在外环还是在学院，应该都没事的样子....”自我安慰"}
{"time": 1757048517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1303016863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=81555483]你在门口的檐下看见了熟悉的粉毛"}
{"time": 1757048541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984988172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "一个人靠着墙坐着，埋着脑袋"}
{"time": 1757048594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1966766302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？艾璃西雅姐姐，你怎么在这里..”走到她跟前，摸摸她的头"}
{"time": 1757049181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754957414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1966766302]\"诶...\"她抬起脑袋，\"呜呜...诺诺，我被困在这了，回不去学院啦...姐姐也找不到...还有乱七八糟的钱要交！\"你注意到她的手腕上比你们多一条白绳"}
{"time": 1757049331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1542216621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“别哭，别哭..“拿出手帕帮她擦擦眼泪”你是因为去找我才回不去的吗....”"}
{"time": 1757049648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565407786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"昨天晚上...回来的时候就进不去...\"眼泪一颗一颗滚落，\"外环也没有进去...呜呜，现在哪里都去不了\""}
{"time": 1757049727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808668954", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起，都怪我...这根绳子是什么，那群蓝衣服的没有把你怎么样吧....”"}
