{"time": 1757099089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518892219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也没有大喊就是了（）"}
{"time": 1757099096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269476106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（大喊就不需要上前了）"}
{"time": 1757099270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785365630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“关于这里的事，你有什么头绪吗”没什么和她寒暄的心情，直接走过去唐突提问"}
{"time": 1757099364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "379579318", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“一个疯子对两个疯子宣战，然后殃及了不知道多少池鱼，未来的池鱼则在观战”*扭头看一眼已经穿的比自己好的某人"}
{"time": 1757099367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "518322791", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实是一眼）"}
{"time": 1757099376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77057725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（确实是一眼）"}
{"time": 1757099383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655737037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "西里斯和爱璃西雅站在不远处，没有急着上来"}
{"time": 1757099398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "59288480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“其实我问的是整个中环...”"}
{"time": 1757099415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1057203171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我怎么知道，你旁边那位怎么都该比我懂吧”"}
{"time": 1757099424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1975709179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "西里斯是一套黑色的套裙，依然是标志性的双马尾，爱璃西雅则是学院的制服，打着绿色的领带"}
{"time": 1757099440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162552974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=04156E6CAAEF22BAD6F4ACA424F51982.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTtD_poMYDZUBfHVlYLc-o8jP2znRjcxgIg_woo_a_Qv6nCjwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQl8FRd_AVOThRF46NWpMbpXoCCQ4&amp;rkey=CAISMDhpYwz0emRNdr2aTrLtF9kx58_UWWBKNDVIvGcUc_j5USO5IRm-_KmFSrWqIHjPsQ,file_size=41820]"}
{"time": 1757099445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "567800950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我们粉毛)"}
{"time": 1757099492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762508783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也许你有什么独特的情报呢，现在情况特殊...应该没有人会想待在疯子的治下吧.”"}
{"time": 1757099567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248210061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没有，但我看未必”*耸耸肩“大家疯得程度半斤八两，只是方向不一样而已”"}
{"time": 1757099650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "417970948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说你的眼睛是瞎了吗”"}
{"time": 1757099670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013480119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有点幸灾乐祸，但努力不表现出来"}
{"time": 1757099673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "550285550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我说是的话你会更开心？”"}
{"time": 1757099807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "7719231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“当然，为什么不开心呢，不过这件事现在不重要...你能参加密会，肯定有你的独到之处，我可以跟你分享两则情报”"}
{"time": 1757099869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "653411285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "干巴巴地“哦”一声，然后等她接着说"}
{"time": 1757099954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "881624214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“其一，有个身处中环的精神向天才，似乎没有被分割进现在这个扭曲的中环”"}
{"time": 1757099977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62264285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“其二是我发现，收敛办事厅这个地方一开始就不存在”"}
{"time": 1757100024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1201465749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“天才有多天才？”"}
{"time": 1757100051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535454219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=62264285]“不存在又是？”"}
{"time": 1757100194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760851516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“总之就是很厉害，至于不存在 我也说不清，当我意识到这件事之后，我就看不见那座建筑了，但西莉丝姐姐她们仍能看清..在她们眼中我就像会穿墙一般”"}
{"time": 1757100220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701181139", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以你作为参加密会的佼佼者，有什么头绪吗”"}
