{"time": 1757265679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501700817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也许至少能离开吧，前提是他们愿意帮忙”"}
