{"time": 1757303285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1919411147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=367772801]（等下，我出门买个饭）"}
{"time": 1757303305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264260903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（刚刚在骑车）"}
{"time": 1757303642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "750972218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "先尝上一口小肉丸，一口咬下去居然还有脆脆的声音，随后在嘴里爆开了，汁水在口腔四溅“烫烫烫....不过好好吃，你们也快点吃...”好像只有自己一个人在吃，有点不好意思"}
{"time": 1757303755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089739745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "香味四溢，不愧是马纳利亚的顶尖餐厅，食材都是新鲜取用，而且珍贵无比。当真是除了贵之外毫无缺点"}
{"time": 1757303890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189434198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*或许闻着下饭……下面包不是坏事。但是总感觉闻着吃的话，反而会觉得吃不下去，进而在想要不要离座的事"}
{"time": 1757304098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325263237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐，西莉丝姐姐你们也快点尝尝吧”"}
{"time": 1757304152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530622229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "爱璃西雅学着诺维拉的样子拿签子扎起小肉丸，吹了几下一口气放进嘴里，随后顿时捧着一边的脸颊露出餍足的表情，\"好好吃...\""}
{"time": 1757304185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "35783110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "西里斯倒是不紧不慢，带着些考究的表情望着啃面包的伊芙"}
{"time": 1757304218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946022970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对吧对吧...感觉这是我吃过最好吃的东西了”"}
{"time": 1757304259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1027873946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我应该，还有19g）"}
{"time": 1757304275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522817959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（精打细算.jpg）"}
{"time": 1757304442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826925571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=35783110]*低着头，连桌子都看不全，自然也不会去看她。何况自己的视野只剩失真的一半"}
{"time": 1757304585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468243365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "再吃一个肉丸，不过这次先吹吹，小口小口的吃，这次到没那么烫了，嘴里充斥着肉香味。然后再去尝口沙拉，吃起来脆生生的，有一种清新的感觉，好像自己此刻置身于森林之中.....回过神来，发现西莉丝姐姐好像在看伊芙"}
{"time": 1757304597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "705729792", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“伊芙小姐，你不吃吗？”"}
{"time": 1757304607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011921746", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“伊芙小姐，你真的不吃吗？”"}
{"time": 1757304708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415210548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*实在是烦了，如先前所言，并不想再被问更多次，于是拿着袋子站起身来往外走“我去外面等你们”"}
{"time": 1757304854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2099237909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1956887620]（）"}
