{"time": 1757391551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "777236767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过在那之前，还要给爱璃西雅小姐开一间房间呢。\"西里斯递出自己的白色卡片，\"诶诶...我不用啦...\"爱璃西雅连连摆手，\"我在外面住就可以...\"她咽了口口水，咕咚一声，显然对这种地方没什么心思"}
{"time": 1757391638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760156613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那艾璃西雅姐姐和我睡一起吧..那床还蛮大的”"}
{"time": 1757392334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "289354033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...我的意思是，我出去住啦...\"她后退两步，\"这种地方...我不合适，不合适...\""}
{"time": 1757392476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454895546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“出去艾璃西雅姐姐又被骗了怎么办..先跟着我们吧”"}
{"time": 1757392493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1942696346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我们来这里也不是急着入住的吧”"}
{"time": 1757392688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "756727419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"总感觉...\"她咬着嘴唇犹豫了一下，最后站在一旁不说话了，但也没就此离开"}
{"time": 1757392745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485080452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”*看了眼时间，也不急着睡觉“我打算先去顶楼看看”"}
{"time": 1757392972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "432054184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我和上来就准备同床共枕的，没什么好说的）"}
{"time": 1757393015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208202446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"上次我就注意到，通往顶层的浮台是关闭的。\"站在大堂你们注意到，除了楼梯之外，对应的楼层也有对应的浮台上行。此时通往五层的显然是未启动的状态。"}
{"time": 1757393075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2077748304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，五层不会禁止无关人员入内吧”"}
{"time": 1757393139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "585846825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“走楼梯？”"}
{"time": 1757393258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558839516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看来这泰坦也不是想见就能见呢？\"西里斯说得很轻，\"先回房间吧。\""}
{"time": 1757393376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1416495700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“按理说，闹得够大总能见到……不过这次就算了。这儿就没什么别的社交场所？”"}
{"time": 1757393583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1771920845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"严格意义上，连实际的政府都没有吧？\"西里斯回答，\"之前也没有，都是学院代管。\""}
{"time": 1757393713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "786283041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“舞会？酒池？好像都没看见，按理说king应该巴不得所有人都看见他才对”"}
{"time": 1757394168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1513418764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...也许有一些变故?\""}
{"time": 1757394434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088790924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "总之，这会四下除了来往的人群，并没有什么其他的动静。"}
{"time": 1757394464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1360890102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“先上四楼？”"}
{"time": 1757394537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186024165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，我也同意先上四楼看看”"}
{"time": 1757394818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "227808320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你们通过浮台上到四楼，西里斯推开套间的门，迎面就是那只紫色的人偶，她微微鞠躬，\"诺亚欢迎两位回家。\""}
{"time": 1757395121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1408253155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“诺亚，你知道怎么上五楼吗”"}
{"time": 1757395488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "490464554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“回家说是”*不免揶揄地小声复读“不过人偶倒是确实……很有意思”"}
{"time": 1757396120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332572068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"抱歉...诺维拉小姐，我无权回答这个问题。如果有疑问，请咨询管理者。\"她抬起头，作为人偶而言，她也有着吹弹可破的皮肤和精致的五官"}
{"time": 1757396180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304082641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“管理者是谁？”"}
{"time": 1757396373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1992591083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"紫色晶石般的眼瞳转向伊芙，但没有回答伊芙的问题，\"嗯...可以回答她的问题。\"西里斯点头之后人偶才开口，\"之前的管理者龙芙小姐已经将权限移交给了泰坦...\""}
{"time": 1757396450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833521779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“在哪里可以找到泰坦...”"}
{"time": 1757396582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1060386518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"抱歉...现在的管理者没有给我回答相关问题的权限...\"她满脸歉意"}
{"time": 1757396658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1520295728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那龙芙小姐的位置呢”"}
{"time": 1757396675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1543039655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那去哪能找到前管理者？”*饶有兴趣地问问“这人偶……还真不错”"}
{"time": 1757397242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328377837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"龙芙小姐...\"人偶微微点头，停顿了一会，\"她愿意和几位对话...请稍等...\""}
{"time": 1757397281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394376830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我要说另一个造物的事了)"}
