{"time": 1757498830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689957320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原因？）"}
{"time": 1757498890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "332423311", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“至少每个泰坦都应该尝试接触一下...解决这里的问题他们三应该缺一不可”"}
{"time": 1757498943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "643704067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“按照对暴力的刻板印象，我们是不是一个人去找比较好啊，感觉那家伙像是会提出活下来的家伙才能问问题的人”"}
{"time": 1757498973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1212877325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"做出这样的判断吗？\"她看向门的方向，\"嗯...那就我去吧。\""}
{"time": 1757499060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1879585439", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我觉得的话，伊芙小姐去好像也挺合适....”"}
{"time": 1757499080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "692394642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(算了，这话好邪恶)"}
