{"time": 1757606741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407795741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(描述一下)"}
{"time": 1757606998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937684013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "之前没有打中的那拳，暴露了那家伙的破绽，仔细盯着那个破绽，然后仅需迅速出剑，随后一剑封喉。剑架在他脖子上，划出一道血痕，仅需稍微用力，那个大块头便会命归黄泉“不想死就快点滚开.....”"}
{"time": 1757607301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1194122061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1326918111]“真方便……如果说复现场景的话……”*想了想“给你看看我家吧？”"}
{"time": 1757607344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1571994786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=937684013]\"戴上铁质的手环，就算会咬人，也是随便玩弄的小猫咪。\"他不屑地看着你，\"动手啊？\"露出了疯狂的神色，\"哈..嘎..哈哈！\""}
{"time": 1757607349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1755841888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我想到了狛枝的笑其实)"}
{"time": 1757607580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1775378369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1194122061]\"哦...妃花很期待呢～\"她眨眨眼，坐在你旁边的沙发上。"}
{"time": 1757607590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642525125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....你以为我不敢吗...”虽然说是这么说，但确实没杀过人...对夺走生命这种事还是有点陌生与害怕"}
{"time": 1757607741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103826731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "手甚至有些略微发抖..."}
{"time": 1757607764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1524381723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你已经输了，能不能赶快消失.”"}
{"time": 1757607826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "234164436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1775378369]*把房间变成自己家的样子。沙发，紫色的大床，一桌子瓶瓶罐罐，还有……水晶棺"}
{"time": 1757607922, "type": "recv", "message_id": "575127005", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1524381723]\"嚯?我为什么会输?\"他迈步向前，你的剑刃一点点深入他的喉咙，连同旁边的人一起包了过来。"}
{"time": 1757607965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "365154086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=234164436]\"哦...城堡里的房间呢...\"她看着棺材 \"嗯嗯...?这个?\""}
{"time": 1757608049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1555681082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你就这么想死吗...”"}
{"time": 1757608087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350781852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是我不能放弃的理由”*没有直说明白“就当是个占位符吧”"}
{"time": 1757608201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1376132022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1555681082]\"那又如何?\"你再僵持不动，他的手触碰到你的同时，你的剑会划破他的喉咙"}
{"time": 1757608242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1665819682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=350781852]\"嗯...\"她出奇地没有介意，\"其实伊芙之前也说过吧...不能放弃的理由...\""}
{"time": 1757608407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916064715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "环绕一下四周..看看有没有什么缺口"}
{"time": 1757608615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659053267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐..怎么办”"}
{"time": 1757608710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "538375427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（你退还是不腿）"}
{"time": 1757608737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1645783518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "往后退，果然还是有点下不去手..."}
{"time": 1757608880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546252204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "或者准确来说，是没有杀人的胆子.."}
{"time": 1757608907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062541279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然自己做过挖心脏的事情..但夺走一条鲜活的生命，果然还是太难了"}
{"time": 1757609003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "754360935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1062541279]他狞笑着，伸手向你抓来，在触碰到之前被西里斯的指挥棒挡住，\"欺负小孩子这种事，可以不要当着监护人的面吗？\"紧接着她的手一挥，周围几个壮汉纷纷被逼退了几步。"}
{"time": 1757609048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684560727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1665819682]“嗯……其实说到底，就只是个……人。只是很简单直接的理由”*靠在沙发上"}
{"time": 1757609207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1139555023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过……原来才过了这么几天……总感觉过了好久啊，这个房间……居然这么怀念”"}
{"time": 1757609298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929160619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起,西莉丝姐姐，我是不是有点没用...”有点失落，如果没有西莉丝姐姐在的话 自己的下场...感觉到一阵后怕"}
{"time": 1757609864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1942875260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1139555023]“嗯...” 妃花轻轻地坐在房间里的沙发上，“这里..会招待哪些人呢？”"}
{"time": 1757610193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655186547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1942875260]“这是卧室……除了母亲，姐姐……只有师母会进来了”"}
{"time": 1757610594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193453095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1929160619]\"不过是个女人，嚣张什么。\"反倒有更多的人围了过来，西里斯捏着指挥棒，有些如临大敌。"}
{"time": 1757610625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151122331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=655186547]\"师母?\"她捕捉到关键词，\"嗯...?\"绿色的瞳孔看向你，期待你的解答"}
{"time": 1757610754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "223686234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是位很自来熟的……前辈？应该是某位金龙的化身。不过平时一直在睡觉”*摇摇头“其实我也不太了解她。她……可能也不太了解我。”"}
{"time": 1757610897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1796670464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=223686234]\"嗯...不了解的话，为什么会是，师傅?\"妃花眨眨眼，\"应该相当了解彼此才对吧？\""}
{"time": 1757610913, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189436576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们跑吧..西莉丝姐姐”"}
{"time": 1757611272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2138175135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1796670464]“真没有……我也只知道这么点了。我没问过，她也不和我说。最后也只是让我每天绕着城堡跑几圈……很难说称职吧？不过不讨厌”"}
{"time": 1757611283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "913429344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=189436576]\"待会数到三，你一直往前跑。记住...不要回头。\"她的一只手摸了摸你的脑袋。"}
{"time": 1757611297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102967876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那西莉丝姐姐呢...”"}
{"time": 1757611320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "645536088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“都怪我，要是我刚刚把那家伙杀了，也许情况还会好一点..”"}
{"time": 1757611353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163681205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"放心，我不会有事的。\"人群逐渐围紧，此情此景，恰如"}
{"time": 1757611380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1835577398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（被魔物包围的那个下午？）"}
{"time": 1757611387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225929654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，龙族）"}
{"time": 1757611417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "775190390", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...有没有谁能帮到我们,我去找她求救...”"}
{"time": 1757611439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211556121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...有没有谁能帮到我们,我去找他求救...”"}
{"time": 1757611450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336548378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉又要去找伊芙求救了）"}
{"time": 1757611476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436058885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我怎么救呢）"}
{"time": 1757611488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "874229573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可能卡珊德拉附体就救了）"}
{"time": 1757611503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920069338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我感觉我该跑个小角落去求里谢娜了）"}
{"time": 1757611587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1694455937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=874229573]（然后减四分之一的命？）"}
{"time": 1757611762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1155491805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2138175135]\"嗯...她没有一起过来吗？\"妃花想象着金龙的样子，不一会儿空气里出现一个金发小女孩的身影"}
{"time": 1757611997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358799500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1211556121]\"不用怕。\"她吐出口气，此时此刻尤为冷静，\"我不会有事\""}
{"time": 1757612028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "92575035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1155491805]“没有，她去找朋友玩了。有时候有一种她比我更像小孩子的感觉”*看着金色头发的小女孩，倒是没有急着纠正"}
{"time": 1757612075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570506452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧..”之前莎木那刻雅都没杀死西莉丝姐姐，这群普通人应该相比来说算小事..艰难的点点头“我会听西莉丝姐姐的话的...”"}
