{"time": 1757623430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167590633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1663022426]\"权柄。\"她说了一个你完全没想到的词汇"}
{"time": 1757623479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547277006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……灾祸的……权柄？”*有些细思恐极。自己从没想过这两个词也能组合在一起"}
{"time": 1757623491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726568537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=352880224]鲜血...飞溅到空中，沾染了你的衣襟，你不由得更加兴奋，从未如此畅快"}
{"time": 1757623574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609490215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=547277006]\"这不是很明显吗？\"她嗤笑了一声，\"巴哈姆特。\"说出这个词的瞬间，房间里升起浓厚的龙威，你一下感觉背上承载千斤之重"}
{"time": 1757623616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1838116049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不断吸收着鲜血，皮肤的裂纹，之前的不适感也逐渐消失了..混沌的意识也稍微有了一丝丝清明，但还是暴戾占据上风"}
{"time": 1757623691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "576902714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "找到之前挑衅自己的人“你之前不是很厉害么”把他踢倒在地，然后踩住他的腿"}
{"time": 1757623732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094263508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呃——”*双膝被迫跪服，即便如此，也依旧难以承受。骨节颤抖血液下流，想说个词都凑不出完整的音节“咳……”"}
{"time": 1757623809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485105352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2094263508]眼前之人似乎也并非全然不受影响，她轻轻咳了一下，权杖泛起红光，在这红光影响下，威压逐渐消散。"}
{"time": 1757623837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634645234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=576902714]\"啊....啊...\"他求饶地看着你，\"对不起...不要杀我啊...啊...！"}
{"time": 1757623888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "296076329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“之前不是很嚣张么”把两把剑剑插进他的手掌，把他钉在地上“你不是不怕死么，怎么现在又求饶了”"}
{"time": 1757623914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1350032194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“很美妙的表情，我很喜欢...”"}
{"time": 1757623999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "167893291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "就在这时，西里斯从背后锁住你，\"不能再胡闹了，快跟我走！\""}
{"time": 1757624004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244118759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=485105352]“……为什么……”*感觉能呼吸了，于是喘两口，但四肢依旧酸软无力“和我说这些？”"}
{"time": 1757624061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712094697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不...不要..”听到西莉丝的声音，下意识的想要逃跑..."}
{"time": 1757624103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "54019240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随着不断吸收四散的鲜血，意识也稍微恢复了一些"}
{"time": 1757624118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208416960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（为什么吸血会恢复（）"}
