{"time": 1757624993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726687438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1870436955]“呃咳……”*这次不得不用手撑着，才不至于五体投地，但脖颈在吱嘎作响“宣誓……宣誓什么？”"}
{"time": 1757625043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864407735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（突然想起来是不是还有个爱莉希雅（）"}
{"time": 1757625059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037876868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想要用力去挣脱..但不知为什么,脑子里一直有个声音在说不要伤害西莉丝...为什么，我想要杀戮，破坏，头疼欲裂...不想想了“放了...我”"}
{"time": 1757625077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479320472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要....拦着我...”"}
