{"time": 1757701148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947870149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=713749935]\"好哦～\"她笑了起来，像是银铃一般，火焰...从你的身上自发的燃起...从红色转为蓝焰"}
{"time": 1757701362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449508993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "重新看向纳哈特，手中凝聚出火球，砸向挡在中间的军队"}
{"time": 1757701730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2085663835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“快点把你的脏手松开...”朝她冲过去，同时身上的火焰愈燃愈烈，把一路上所有的东西烧为飞灰"}
{"time": 1757702023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160813091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=48097829]（）"}
