{"time": 1757879296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "150667288", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果你来的话，你不能碰西莉丝姐姐..只能用工具碰...”强忍着头痛说出这句话"}
{"time": 1757879349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544179058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=181139563]*看她表演，咬死不松口。有这一次，后面这人不知道会有多得寸进尺"}
{"time": 1757879482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867259510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1544179058]\"唉，你这家伙。\"她还想说什么，房门被人推开。"}
{"time": 1757879521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "900547308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=150667288]诺亚意外地没有动静，爱璃西雅有些发抖。除了柯艾特，她无奈地摊摊手，你们全都望向门外。"}
{"time": 1757879694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946147626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（谁啊）"}
{"time": 1757879759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320354535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（谁啊）"}
{"time": 1757879767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105936608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在妾身这里，还真是演出了一场大戏呢。\"来人的语气带着稍稍的不快，白色的衣摆先一步进了屋，熟悉的衣服，脸上没有戴面具，也没有戴手套，露出了有些漆黑的下半手臂和稍长的指甲，绿色的瞳孔里盛着一些愠恼，脑后的发环打理地很干净。"}
{"time": 1757879788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "586245528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是龙芙...）"}
{"time": 1757879811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "452676167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你也要抓我吗....”"}
{"time": 1757879925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123802550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“龙芙小姐……”*稍有些放松，不过仍绷着神经。说到底，自己在这些人眼里，恐怕并没有不能死的理由，能相信的终究只有自己"}
{"time": 1757880118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "138215110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随时准备放血"}
{"time": 1757880167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410303954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=452676167]\"啧，麻烦的家伙一个又一个。\"她看着你，皱着眉，\"妾身这里的空气都脏了。\"无声的风席卷整个房间，\"我有说过你可以对峙吗？\"属于龙的威压弥漫整个房间，同等地压在每一个人身上"}
{"time": 1757880206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1980309849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "房间里的光线瞬间暗了下来，空气中有静电啪啪作响"}
{"time": 1757880211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40052634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "抱起西莉丝姐姐准备逃跑"}
