{"time": 1757899007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018954321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1252948112]*依旧还蜷着，没有下地走路，自然是随着柯艾特"}
{"time": 1757899066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "641576330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2035790372]\"都是你一厢情愿吧？\"她瞥了你一眼，\"总之你先在这里反省个三天三夜。\""}
{"time": 1757899080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1514257360", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "操控血翼去试图撕碎锁链，虽然被电击的滋味很不好受，但再也见不到西莉丝姐姐...不行，不能这样，我要和西莉丝姐姐永远在一起"}
{"time": 1757899107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "616577387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“三天后，我就能见到她了吗”"}
{"time": 1757899206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "591730024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1018954321]柯艾特带着你先上了楼，整个五层是一整个单间，布置得很有园林的感觉，入门便是几道屏风，甚至有小桥流水，西里斯被安置在一扇屏风后面，诺亚正在处理她的伤口，大半已经处理好，身上各处缠着绷带，眼下正在思考怎么给脖子上的淤青遮瑕，爱璃西雅给她打着下手。"}
{"time": 1757899334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229080320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（穿个高领毛衣就好了，反正是春天（））"}
{"time": 1757899368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "4882218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……晚上好，我来给你们增添工作量了”"}
{"time": 1757899416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361391038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=616577387]\"我不知道，别问我。没看出我很烦吗？\"她的语气很冲，\"你见不见跟我有什么关系\""}
{"time": 1757899503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "174097643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....”想要说些什么，但还是不继续得罪她了，万一她直接让这辈子都见不到西莉丝姐姐就不好了，区区三天而已，等得起"}
{"time": 1757899542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1769639343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一会就下来跟你说很润）"}
{"time": 1757899624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413579985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=4882218]两人都没接话，今晚的事对她们的冲击大概不小"}
{"time": 1757899629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1875824575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我翅膀又没被绑住）"}
