{"time": 1757899681, "type": "recv", "message_id": "843920174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=174097643]等得起...?做出这种思考的自己...真的纯粹吗？不管是破坏...侮蔑...还是爱欲，皆被玷污。"}
