{"time": 1757956749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "784268955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=7547050]\"嗯哼?\"她的手指搭在脖子上，微微歪着头，\"可以哦?提一提嘛。\""}
{"time": 1757956796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "237399345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我..我来提吗，那里榭娜姐姐可以吻我吗....”"}
{"time": 1757957207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041942970", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1188642740]\"可能是，水盈则溢...\"她脸上几乎"}
{"time": 1757957249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061483555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1188642740]\"可能是，水盈则溢...\"听到你的话，她换回笑嘻嘻的表情，\"败血症，知道吗？\""}
{"time": 1757957374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1292811474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=237399345]\"哇哦～\"她眯着眼睛，脸上挂着笑，手指点在你的唇瓣上，\"可是...你都不是初吻诶，感觉好掉价哦～\""}
{"time": 1757957440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639090524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对...对不起..里榭娜姐姐能抱抱我已经很好了，我不该有不切实际的幻想的....”"}
{"time": 1757957633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500492522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1061483555]“……那叫透支”*总感觉来了这里之后度日如年地在变老，下意识摸摸人中，看看有没有在流鼻血"}
{"time": 1757957742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "944204366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1639090524]\"难道说，诺诺其实是很色情的孩子?\"她的手指依然点在你的唇上，\"想要吗？\""}
{"time": 1757957864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1859091249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "害羞的...诚实的点了点头"}
{"time": 1757958005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1963015805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1500492522]当然并没有，\"嗯?\"她看着你的动作不免有些好笑，\"差不多吧，不过血管里出问题的概率更高...百分百！\"突然神气地补充"}
{"time": 1757958080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031355972", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“想..想要...”"}
{"time": 1757958176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687235691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1963015805]“……神经病”*懒得再理她，把头往杯子里一闷“诺亚小姐，西里斯醒了之后麻烦叫我一下……我得眯一会”"}
{"time": 1757958314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "80989652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1031355972]手指从你的唇上移开，双手捧着你的脸颊，你眼看着她和你的距离越来越近..."}
{"time": 1757958362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683183819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1687235691]\"记得付钱就行。\"她补充道，\"一共两千金币，承蒙惠顾。\""}
{"time": 1757958367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "138926950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "慢慢闭上双眼，期待着要发生的事情..."}
{"time": 1757958576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191381823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=138926950]她的气息越来越近...直到...你真的感受到了温软的唇瓣，带着一些葡萄的香气，引你沉醉...不由得深陷其中...再度...再度朝着她之中坠落"}
{"time": 1757958606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391440811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1683183819]诺亚的声音过了一会才传过来，只有一声很轻的\"嗯。\""}
{"time": 1757958637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335668179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1683183819]*完全不想理她，睡！"}
{"time": 1757958786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32914024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "里榭娜姐姐,好喜欢...好舒服，身体一直以来的躁动终于好像得到了压制，心灵久违的感觉到了平静"}
{"time": 1757958946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525930689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1335668179]身体疲惫...加上受伤和修复...确实是放松下来的瞬间...意识就沉沉睡去..."}
{"time": 1757959024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "816927731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=32914024]不过很快，你察觉到温软的唇就要离开你身前，这个吻即将结束...心情不由得再次燥热"}
{"time": 1757959185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1253654068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想要用翅膀阻止她离开，但扇动再三，最终还是耷拉了下来...里榭娜姐姐能赐这个吻已经是天大的恩赐了....不能奢求更多..."}
{"time": 1757959299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "181445008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她从你身前离开，你感觉到她的气息远去，\"可以了哦?\"嘴角依然余着葡萄的香气，还有些许残存的唾液..."}
{"time": 1757959309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1255755565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1525930689](可以过一个灵感)"}
