{"time": 1758049685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1318672015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "简直是...有人在无时无刻人为操纵这些丝线..."}
{"time": 1758049756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "5344321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=101594433]\"好啦好啦。\"她摸摸你的脑袋，整个人身上有一股淡雅的花卉香气，\"真的是，这么喜欢撒娇?\""}
{"time": 1758049857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1576712152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“里榭娜姐姐太好了，我忍不住...”感觉好舒服，不管是抱着里榭娜姐姐还是被摸头....“我的要求会不会有点难实现...”"}
{"time": 1758049866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935675285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1318672015]瞳孔缩了缩，冷汗来得比撒手更快。在因为在撒手之前，最后发力切割"}
{"time": 1758050189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1385888464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1576712152]\"不会哦?\"她轻轻地笑了笑，\"对我而言，这算是满足你呢\""}
{"time": 1758050256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916328193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "已经不知道说了多少句谢谢了，但感觉越来越开心“我会努力完成里榭娜姐姐交给我的任务的....”"}
