{"time": 1758050936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "563638948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*心底净是不详的预感，刚才松手似乎太快又太迟，好像该斩的没斩开，该躲的也没躲掉，试着甩开妃花的手"}
{"time": 1758051063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497635432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她的手没有握得很紧，被你甩开，\"快...走...\""}
{"time": 1758051174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "147626491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啧，我倒是想走”*看看自己的左臂，感觉没办法一次性把金线全剥离了。如果这把匕首现在是anti安息，那……就对自己下刀试试"}
{"time": 1758051208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "13526132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*深呼吸，在疼痛反射到来之前一口气把匕首捅入左肩"}
{"time": 1758051410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "171729984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=175577338]\"嗯。\"她从你的脑袋上把手移下来，\"现在去见见西里斯么？\""}
{"time": 1758051449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "914232803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好!”"}
{"time": 1758051517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504967737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过怎么去呢..直接过去会不会被龙芙发现”"}
{"time": 1758051744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1481825931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=13526132]剧痛感勉强抗衡了那股暖流，你勉强维持了清醒"}
{"time": 1758051880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1151717583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呃啊——”*双腿发软跪倒在地，连拔出的力气也没有，徒劳地流着冷汗，咬着牙关，迷茫地挣扎着"}
{"time": 1758052038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1692258443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=504967737]\"不会。\"她摸摸你的脑袋，身形开始变得虚幻起来，\"越过那扇门\""}
{"time": 1758052079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215313001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯”里榭娜姐姐还能害我不成，按她指引的方向走"}
{"time": 1758052113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "68651013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“里榭娜姐姐是要走了吗...”"}
{"time": 1758052305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "114701108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1151717583]\"伊芙...听我说...\"妃花开口，声音有些艰难"}
{"time": 1758052530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373433544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=114701108]“……呼……哈……”*大口喘息着“我在……听……”"}
{"time": 1758052530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1407105855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=68651013]\"嗯，之后会有人来接你的。\""}
{"time": 1758052549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189003523", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“之后姐姐还会来找我吗...”"}
{"time": 1758052551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1913890997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1407105855]\"拜拜咯，那会是你的...第一次有意义的见面呢\""}
{"time": 1758052803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811287076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走之前，我可以吻一次姐姐吗..”有些害羞的戳手指"}
{"time": 1758052895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146519559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=373433544]\"...你不能留在这里...这里是...梦...只要...把我杀了...就好。\""}
{"time": 1758053028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1912001851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我又……不是不知道”*右手撑地，视野有些脱色，勉强站起来“……醒了之后，我该去哪找你？”"}
{"time": 1758053257, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891696080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=811287076]\"诶...诺诺果然是色情的孩子诶。\"她笑了笑，随后她停在空气里，\"那你，来吧。\""}
{"time": 1758053333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277518188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1912001851]\"...我在...马纳利亚。\"她轻轻地笑了一下，虽然有些勉强，\"不要找我...\""}
{"time": 1758053444, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970683558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "小心翼翼的上前，感觉有些紧张“一想到好久见不到姐姐了..难免有些伤心”慢慢的吻上里榭娜的唇，心里却有些迫不及待"}
{"time": 1758053572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063845431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1277518188]\"我害怕...你也会...被卷入...所以...\"她的手颤抖地抬起，似乎想捏捏你的脸，\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1758053822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810657737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=970683558](自己描述一下)"}
{"time": 1758053832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716849275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1758054431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490413431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一开始只是简单的接触...好舒服，身体好像整个软了下来，又一次感觉到了放松，对了，和刚刚相比，如今终于从束缚中解放了，有些后知后觉轻轻的抱住了里榭娜姐姐..里榭娜姐姐的嘴唇好软，还香香的，好快乐,好满足...但还不够，脑子忽然冒出了这个念头，心中的爱欲也再次躁动起来，想要更多..完全没来得及思考，就不自觉的把舌头伸了出去.."}
{"time": 1758054804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325027487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(厉害)"}
{"time": 1758054915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450167853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1758054964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329704586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1490413431]\"呃...\"她发出了轻轻的叮咛，\"不要.."}
{"time": 1758055205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "692805482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "身上的那股躁动终于又再次平静了下来，意识也稍稍清醒了一点,才意识到自己究竟做了什么..有些害怕，但又有些开心，有一种很刺激的感觉..慢慢的收回去，然后恋恋不舍的分开"}
{"time": 1758055360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688226102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（龙哥好像睡着了）"}
{"time": 1758055537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776585401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=692805482]\"真是...\"你们分开的嘴角挂着晶莹的液滴，\"贪心的孩子。\""}
{"time": 1758055675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084125047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“太喜欢里榭娜姐姐了，一时没忍住...”"}
{"time": 1758055745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "869086612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“见不到姐姐的日子..我会一直想着姐姐的”"}
{"time": 1758055867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "893912428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样就好哦?\"她的身形消散，\"待会和来接你的人离开吧。\""}
{"time": 1758055909, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431154928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....姐姐再见，我会好好期待和姐姐的下次见面的”"}
{"time": 1758056130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1468981172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她的身形消散，周围的光线有些昏暗"}
{"time": 1758056213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "232499266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉心里好像有点空落落的，有点不知所措的朝那扇门走过去"}
{"time": 1758056526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1259497918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=232499266]房门似乎有些变化，比起之前，多了些白色的花纹在其上"}
{"time": 1758056627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "689196793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "之前欣喜的心情逐渐变的失落，但一想到要面对西莉丝便有些忐忑，思考再三，最终还是迈出了向前的步伐"}
{"time": 1758056976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "115306571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=689196793]推开门，里面是静静躺在床榻上的她...身上多处缠绕着绷带...脖子上还有没有消掉的淤青"}
{"time": 1758068842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312604835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1063845431]“好吧，好吧……”蠕动着靠近一些，反复拽个五六次，终于在脱力前把匕首又抽出来，思考着体面一点的捅法"}
