{"time": 1758106465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628575054", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我一定会回来的，西莉丝姐姐，你放心吧”在她的额头上轻轻吻一下"}
{"time": 1758106498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1123895937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不用担心我啦，我已经不是小孩子了，大概吧”"}
{"time": 1758106690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199609173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐一定要注意安全，不要在往危险的地方跑了....”"}
{"time": 1758106720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1131483236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1578498084]*点点头“我知道了。这边有人信仰安息的教义吗？”"}
{"time": 1758106904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593870914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*想起来监狱里那帮活死人"}
{"time": 1758107617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766919898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=199609173]她一直紧抓着你的手腕，虽然看上去柔弱，但...意外地透着倔强，\"不行，你有问过我同意吗？\""}
{"time": 1758107629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617603527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1131483236]\"嗯...之前应该没有。现在不清楚\""}
{"time": 1758107969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "168269810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...我欠里榭娜姐姐的已经还不清了,我也很想一直和西莉丝姐姐待在一起，但是”无奈的摇了摇头“我很喜欢西莉丝姐姐，但是欠别人恩情不还，我有点做不到..更何况是欠的里榭娜姐姐的”"}
{"time": 1758107991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95661326", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且...里榭娜姐姐答应我，可以让我再见一次师父和露露...”"}
{"time": 1758108134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621907604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1617603527]“嗯……之后去宾森特那边看看好了”*摇了摇头“没事了。人偶需要睡觉吗？”"}
