{"time": 1758108360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "827635627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那你怎么不强调一下（）"}
{"time": 1758108540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1432304879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1621907604]\"我记得，伊芙小姐今天第二次问这个问题了。\"她摇头，\"我不需要。\""}
{"time": 1758108576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409327727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我撤回了）"}
{"time": 1758108653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271539045", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“接我的人还没来，我应该还能陪西莉丝姐姐一会...”"}
{"time": 1758108945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "288870375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且目前来看...我呆在西莉丝姐姐身边只会给姐姐添麻烦吧 已经有不少人发现我的存在了，万一因为我，西莉丝姐姐出事了...”身体忍不住发抖"}
{"time": 1758109039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105242251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1432304879]“嗯……”在认真思考要不要大半夜出发的事"}
{"time": 1758109249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011167229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1271539045]\"...\"她轻轻摇摇头，\"这是我的责任，诺诺不用担心...所以...不要一个人离开，可以吗？\""}
