{"time": 1758112932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2059943641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=613677902]\"...我也很在意，所以...\"她的水晶眼瞳在夜灯下熠熠生辉"}
{"time": 1758112988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1087455461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“在意？”*有些好奇“在意什么？……不过我当然没有意见，留个纸条，然后出发吧”"}
