{"time": 1758127243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533717226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1368908216]少顷，她突然笑了起来，随后带着些少女感开口，\"既然说是你的人...那你不是要带上我一起?\""}
{"time": 1758127336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190534335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”没想到她会说这样的话“但是那边都是魔族哎，会很危险的，西莉丝姐姐不怕吗...”"}
{"time": 1758127382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521399809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然满脑子都在回答好的好的，但最终还是问出了这个问题"}
{"time": 1758127513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897313328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1087455461]\"她们离开之后发生了什么...\"她思考了一会，如此开口，\"我想弄清楚...本来一切都好好的...\""}
{"time": 1758127662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659895214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且西莉丝姐姐，你伤的好重...得好好养伤”理智在疯狂的扇那个想答应西莉丝姐姐的自己 那边都是坏家伙，你一定能保护住她吗，万一呢万一呢"}
{"time": 1758127719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923503479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=659895214]\"确实呢...\"她从床上坐起来，\"你在这里有看见别的人吗？房间里。\""}
{"time": 1758127778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1951345619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有吗？我只看见了西莉丝姐姐”在她起身的时候急忙小心的扶着她"}
{"time": 1758127962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1257501853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1897313328]“没关系，走吧走吧”"}
{"time": 1758127970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77224847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1951345619]\"嗯...诺亚，爱璃西雅...都没见到吗？\""}
{"time": 1758127985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361056635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "迷茫的摇摇头"}
{"time": 1758128015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920966041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我的眼里只有西莉丝姐姐呢”"}
{"time": 1758128215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409029390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1257501853](重走来时路)"}
{"time": 1758128252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468529348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*先下楼"}
{"time": 1758128454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062040636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1920966041]\"说这种话可不管用哦?认真说啦。\""}
{"time": 1758128515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1887371677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“开个玩笑啦”挠挠头“不过我真的没有看见其他人..只看到了西莉丝姐姐，emmm，应该是里榭娜姐姐帮了我吧，要不我可能现在已经被龙芙抓回去了”"}
{"time": 1758128703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678510096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话说这个让我想到了一部叫六花的勇者的日漫，里面女主好像也是魔族混血，但是她被选中成为了六个勇者之一，然后她家里人好像把男主给屠村了，但是魔王军有个干部给男主下了暗示，让男主遇到女主的时候就会一见钟情）"}
{"time": 1758128761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442285966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（后来在男主的追求下，女主爱上了男主，后来男主知道自己家里人死跟女主有一点点关联也没有怪她，因为她相信肯定不是女主做的）"}
{"time": 1758128789, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474531276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=468529348]楼下没什么人，只有前台的接待在百无聊赖地翻开报纸，今天的事情闹得很大，并没有人流这个点"}
{"time": 1758128828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037242793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但是最后那个干部解除了对男主的暗示，男主瞬间就对女主没有感情了，他知道这样是错的，但他无论怎么样都无法喜欢上女主，并且因为女主和他家人的关联，他一看到女主只有满满的恨（）"}
{"time": 1758128847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30253889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我的意思是）"}
{"time": 1758128851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014479668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（四楼那个）"}
{"time": 1758128888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "464457130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉有种既视感（）"}
{"time": 1758128970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1672922286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(四楼那个?)"}
