{"time": 1758218802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409564313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1536752291]“哦~你想试试？”菈菈靠近你两步，西里斯则是拉住你，“不可以...唯有灵魂不容残缺。”"}
{"time": 1758218834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1132107066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“什么时候……才能解决……”*麻木地看向门口“我不该在这里……不想在这里……”"}
{"time": 1758218863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286179217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我...我也不知道我该怎么办了，明明答应了别人，结果到头来还是做不到...”有些自责"}
{"time": 1758219136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136515421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=286179217]“嚯？那么，你现在想怎么做？”她俯下身看向你，表情有些捉摸不透，“现在的你。”"}
{"time": 1758219173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681954738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1132107066]“但是伊芙现在就在这里。”诺亚指出这一点，“现状，就是这样。必须振作起来”"}
{"time": 1758219333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783785458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不要……为什么是……我？宾森特在干嘛……”*表情狰狞起来“明明就在他脚下……为什么……”"}
{"time": 1758219390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828924643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我....”握着西莉丝姐姐的手“我不能去魔族那边...至少现在肯定不行”"}
