{"time": 1758224356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1918128622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1934108544]\"学院长...嗯...学院的教授...\"她慢慢开口，\"还有...你身体里的那一位...\""}
{"time": 1758224402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046507861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉好像不在像之前那样有毁灭一切的冲动，好像可以更好的控制自己的情绪了，好像还不错？"}
{"time": 1758224472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534406747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢菈菈姐姐...我感觉自己的脑子好像终于不在像之前那样乱糟糟的，清净了好多...”"}
{"time": 1758224500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780860011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1907385944]\"毕竟，侮蔑啦，破坏啦，和你不怎么相配吧？演出喜剧也让人生厌的程度。\"她伸出手摸摸你的脑袋，\"不过，那些能力也一样不剩咯～\"\n西里斯皱皱眉，过了一会才开口，\"...诺诺...记忆是很重要的东西...真的没有了吗？\""}
{"time": 1758224548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "23565517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（破坏的能力是什么，感觉我好像没用过？）"}
{"time": 1758224617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "38616636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1918128622]“我体内的……现在都很麻烦”*克制着运动的本能，只靠右腿发力坐起来“……呜……还有办法就好……”"}
{"time": 1758224619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922971879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(发箍)"}
{"time": 1758224648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1411570073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过，诺亚……”*往她那边倒了倒“……我好委屈……”"}
{"time": 1758224653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "57851855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=38616636](不是事啦，你又不是不认识，埃忒尔)"}
