{"time": 1758227972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1602263652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1848153244]随后你的意识上浮...一睁眼便是一个陌生的女孩，正饶有兴趣地打量着你"}
{"time": 1758227999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001504882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1801250954]\"我吗？\"她看着路，\"没有。\""}
{"time": 1758228013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266746149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你是来接我的人？怎么称呼？”"}
{"time": 1758228049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042234390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2001504882]“没有吗？”*睁开眼睛看她“我看你对人类很感兴趣”"}
{"time": 1758228160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223146313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1602263652]女孩穿着华丽的古典白衣，着着繁复的黑色百褶裙，踩着过膝黑色斑纹格子袜和小皮鞋，脑袋上除了正常耳朵还有一对红色的蝙蝠翅膀，瞳色如血，看得出金发仔细地打理过，梳得很整齐。"}
{"time": 1758228213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2002485261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1042234390]\"这是兴趣，不能说是想做的事吧？\"她开口，\"诺亚是人偶。\""}
{"time": 1758228228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "339982938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1223146313]（有立绘吗（）"}
{"time": 1758228341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1790780816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2002485261]“人偶也可以有想做的事……”*理所应当地开口“诺亚是特别的，至少对我而言是”"}
{"time": 1758228360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1333815343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=D3371BAC7A5D8EA77262BADD48939D79.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQGZxNW9ywaEOZXH57zDCvmumQ-WBiuwQkg_woo5JWThpfjjwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQSETCU1i_QeACU6tpClvILnoCRyKCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMG7cfQnENvsDcbKI_Lyj7GRfbVr_f7KtgOafWj-lnIT65_fDsRUX-6aYi8OjMwUV6Q,file_size=155822]"}
