{"time": 1758228579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810750162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=266746149]\"好没礼貌，斑比酱很生气。\"她走上前，扯下你用血做的翅膀，尝试性咬了一口，随后喝下肚。不过你也感觉到那些血正在慢慢失去控制"}
{"time": 1758228590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780151162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=854402744]“那与我无关，它再特别也没有把我从那里救出来”*伸手点在她的额头上“在我这里，你就是最好的人偶”"}
{"time": 1758228610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243063922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“痛痛痛，对不起....我不应该对你这样说话”"}
{"time": 1758228639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1104588639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（会痛吗？）"}
