{"time": 1758230097, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530869500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2028989741]“……以后也不需要你了。诺亚，我们走”*只是瞥一眼就收回视线。这人已经不值得自己的目光再停留半秒"}
{"time": 1758230134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "476454566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“晚点的话，我每天让你喝血都可以...”"}
