{"time": 1758230498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968516859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我想到我怎么隐藏外观了）"}
{"time": 1758230507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1502805026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1576146236]\"那就算咯。\"她看上去完全不在意，语气也是懒洋洋的，\"别忘了每年的金币就行。\""}
