{"time": 1758230629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504660889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1502805026]“我们上去吧”*低头抵在诺亚肩膀上"}
{"time": 1758230668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1770437374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（只能去欺负欺负伊芙，朝她借点血（bushi）"}
{"time": 1758230772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364458166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=504660889]\"嗯...\"等到你们上楼，诺亚摇了摇你，递给你一瓶淡粉色的试剂，\"伊芙小姐，要我喂你吗？\""}
{"time": 1758230819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223359701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1092114057]\"嗯?\"她睁大了眼，\"这样吗？可以哦，我同意了。\""}
{"time": 1758230832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1546796073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=364458166]“这是什么？”*接过试剂稍微晃晃“我手又没断……”"}
{"time": 1758230879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "294151774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那谢谢斑比酱了...对了，你有什么隐藏的办法吗”"}
{"time": 1758231011, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363751540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1546796073]\"...\"她支支吾吾了，\"应该有用...伊芙小姐....不是想..完完整整回去吗？\""}
