{"time": 1758232574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42656364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1753077974]*不管了，仰头吞下药液“和她相处不代表我要忍着她”"}
{"time": 1758232614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2097781889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，我应该是没有这种能力了....如果我把翅膀给砍下来，角用帽子盖住..能不能藏住呢”"}
{"time": 1758232783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114633409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=42656364]药剂入口带着甜甜的草莓味，让你怀疑是不是真的能起作用，但随后一股灼热涌入你的腹腔，顷刻你感觉左边小腿以下痒痒的，另外...左边的胸口有一种燃烧感"}
{"time": 1758232821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1566096633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2097781889]\"嗯...\"西里斯对你眨眨眼，示意你问一问脑袋上的那个小家伙"}
{"time": 1758232900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760264639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱...你提点建议吧..如果不能好好的隐藏身份的话，说不定哪天我被人打死你就喝不到我的血了...”"}
{"time": 1758232943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409385766", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2114633409]“呃……”*靠在沙发上扭动着“怎么……难道是不死鸟……？好烫”"}
{"time": 1758233061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110019802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哪来的沙发，你还被抱在怀里来着，现在还没到四楼)"}
{"time": 1758233131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "699417242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1760264639]\"麻烦，你要当血裔吗？\"她的声音有些细，\"当我的血裔，你也可以变成蝙蝠。\""}
{"time": 1758233153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "915372508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1758233192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659275232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？听起来好像不错，那有什么代价呢”"}
{"time": 1758233223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1653294546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2114633409]“唔……”*有些不安地扭动着，攥着自己的心口“怎么会……烫……难道是不死鸟……”"}
{"time": 1758233297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1059656553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=659275232]\"渴求鲜血?然后，反正要听斑比酱的话。\""}
{"time": 1758233356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642213509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话说这是心里对话，还是都能听见）"}
{"time": 1758233360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "315591019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1653294546]所幸那感觉很快就消去，诺亚看向你，目光有些探究，你们上去五楼的路上可以看见贴着封条的房门现在被打开了。"}
