{"time": 1758233701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1872359704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1903661793]\"切。\"她没好气地吱了一声，小蝙蝠毫不留情地咬了一口你的头皮，嘶，这是真痛"}
