{"time": 1758299702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "914779355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=677940674]\"嗯，在真正会魔法的人眼中...\"她点头，\"不过普通人是很难看出来的。\""}
{"time": 1758299806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1752157454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，既然这样，那我只要把身上所有的魔族特征都割掉...应该也可以吧”"}
