{"time": 1758306558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1186885090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "试图把翅膀上的血全部回收了，虽然斑比吃了好几个，但应该还剩点"}
{"time": 1758306704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "845680822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"龙芙小姐...\"西里斯扶着你，\"她的意思是，诺诺只要不出现在她面前碍眼，她就不打算管你。\"回收了血之后感觉稍微好了些"}
{"time": 1758306846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194939999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那拜托...西莉丝姐姐..帮我谢谢龙芙小姐了”感觉还是有点缓不过来..."}
{"time": 1758306995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445509426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "爱璃西雅似乎对小蝙蝠很好奇，凑上去拿出手指准备揉揉脑袋"}
{"time": 1758307047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2011106777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1492389480]时间滴答滴答一分一秒走过....然而自始至终，这里只有你一个人静静地躺着。"}
{"time": 1758307102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649689366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐...小心她咬你..”虽然有些虚弱，但还是忍不住去提醒她"}
{"time": 1758307202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "26685985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2011106777]对休眠略有些恐惧，不敢闭眼，无聊得紧，但是也没什么能动的"}
{"time": 1758307322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774458254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1649689366]此刻斑比倒是喝得肚子鼓鼓的，一副人畜无害的样子，由着爱璃西雅揉脑袋，\"唔...\"不过她依然开口，\"只有...嗝...一次机会...嗝...快点。\""}
{"time": 1758307442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "980159252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她叫斑比，斑比酱，摸你的是艾璃西雅姐姐，另一位是西莉丝姐姐”介绍一下双方"}
{"time": 1758307546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983479858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=26685985](那你也许可以过一个幸运，成功有奖励，失败有惩罚。)"}
{"time": 1758307554, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167242954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+1"}
{"time": 1758307554, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1167242954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]演奏出: 1D20+1={11}+1=12"}
{"time": 1758307556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1753527623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（hhh）"}
{"time": 1758307734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1880570569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=980159252]\"无所谓。\"她眼看着又要动嘴咬你，\"快点决定，之后我才懒得管你。\""}
{"time": 1758307819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1233104293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但是最近失血真的有点多了，不能自由活动的话，迟早会被斑比吸死，斑比酱好像也不是那么不讲理的人..算了，拼了"}
{"time": 1758307855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883769236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "终于下定了决心“那拜托斑比酱了，我愿意做你的血裔...”"}
{"time": 1758307911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794452214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=26685985]\"哦～这里还有一个有趣的猎物～\"房间的阴影里传出折叠的混响音，听不清楚男女年轻或衰老等等等等"}
{"time": 1758308128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1524972132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1794452214]“……”*暂不回话，心说龙芙这儿到底是什么地方，怎么这么多人想来就来？"}
{"time": 1758308178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711908426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=883769236]\"啧。\"她从你的脑袋上飞起来，摇身一变变回金发的少女，看了看周围的两人，\"她们两呢？\""}
{"time": 1758308209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665840324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？我自己就够了...”"}
{"time": 1758308260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203830058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1524972132]\"不回话也不管用哦?\"阴影在角落里翻涌，没有凝成人形，\"我既然路过的话，让我尝一尝你的灵魂吧～\""}
{"time": 1758308319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2020100365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=665840324]\"随便吧。\"她看向你，\"靠过来。\""}
{"time": 1758308358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861433461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……你不知道这里是什么地方吗？”*一看就是自己没法应对的家伙，色厉内荏地希望对方知难而退"}
{"time": 1758308361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "45124861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”慢慢靠过去“我需要怎么做...”"}
{"time": 1758308758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "994452186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这人在沙发上睡着了说是）"}
{"time": 1758308769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748358915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(?)"}
{"time": 1758308787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1304433114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那你把他叫醒吧，别感冒了）"}
{"time": 1758308811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "89465918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（他白天不是睡了一整天么）"}
{"time": 1758309297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "963597078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=45124861]\"露出脖子。\""}
{"time": 1758309313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467975719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊酱复活了？）"}
{"time": 1758309331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1806810624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（他看了一眼手机又放下了）"}
{"time": 1758309373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626525133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "好像猜到了她要做什么，扒开衣服 露出脖子“你...轻点”"}
{"time": 1758309497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1161892080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1861433461]\"嚯嚯～\"她的声音听起来十分有九分不在意，\"反正，抓不到我。\""}
{"time": 1758309522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2061596762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是那个骗子（bushi）"}
{"time": 1758309741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197673862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1161892080]“……”*从沙发上坐起来，往声音的来源看看，只有没知觉的右腿触地，怎么想都跑不了"}
{"time": 1758309794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1341264546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1626525133]\"当然是，彻彻底底换一遍血。\"她附在你脖子间，一张嘴，尖牙没入脖颈的血管，你只觉酥麻传遍全身各处...紧接着便是身体急速失血导致的眩晕感"}
{"time": 1758309914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "196294284", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1197673862]阴影攀附着墙壁缓缓靠向你，\"一点点灵魂就够，我看你也没意见吧。\""}
{"time": 1758309919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "845570126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "明明在屋子里，怎么能看到星星呢..想要扶住什么，努力去稳住身形..好奇怪的感觉"}
{"time": 1758309989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506861422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=196294284]“有意见，可以换点别的么？我挺喜欢我的脑子的”*手靠着沙发扶手，不论如何，还是要准备尝试一下跑路的"}
{"time": 1758310161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "530824541", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=845570126](那你扶啊)"}
