{"time": 1758375717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522652115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=776894695]“……”*只觉得棘手到爆，偏偏自己这时候还山穷水尽“你要是真想谈……我们可以谈谈你怎么才能放过我”"}
{"time": 1758375743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2068300910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我教你）"}
