{"time": 1758375824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40721908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1758377136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "490475558", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（身为一个坏比，祸水东引不是很正常么）"}
{"time": 1758377182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1861690125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（下意识会把你们当一伙对不对）"}
{"time": 1758377519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1389648192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（会吗）"}
{"time": 1758378016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1468209809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1325678615]\"...\"西里斯伸出手，正准备说什么，被爱璃西雅拦下来，\"嗯...我可以...\"她卷起袖子伸过去，\"能帮上忙的话...我很开心...\""}
{"time": 1758378077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933190156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=522652115]\"可以啊，把你的灵魂放在天平的一边，另一边由你来添置筹码咯\""}
{"time": 1758378284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1053238870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢你，艾璃西雅姐姐...不过你觉得自己承受不住了记得说一下，我会救你的...”"}
{"time": 1758378861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2126287093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1053238870]斑比拉过她的手，无视爱璃西雅的惊呼，一口咬在她的腕子上，\"呃...疼...\"你注意到鲜血成线流下些许顺着手腕，还有一些从斑比的嘴角滴下，而你...居然也好想尝一尝味道..."}
{"time": 1758378966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998573358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1933190156]“……我拒绝，我的灵魂还有别的用处”"}
{"time": 1758379048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "146476195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不自觉的咽了咽口水...."}
{"time": 1758379050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001365224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=998573358]\"有吗？诶～\"阴影在你四周打转，\"我为什么看不出来?\""}
{"time": 1758379159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583005230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你当然看不出来……魔族”*至少找到一处可以靠着的墙面，拿出并没有用的刀"}
{"time": 1758379553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676571859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱，你少吸点...”虽然是因为害怕艾璃西雅姐姐出事，但嘴角的口水实在容易让人误解"}
{"time": 1758379746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1750642397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1583005230]\"我觉得你还算有趣...\"空气似乎在嗤笑，“不说点有趣的事情的话打起我的兴趣，人家现在就可以吞吃你的一切呢。”"}
{"time": 1758379997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1052305669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=676571859]她抬起头看了你一眼，爱璃西雅的脸很红，似乎很舒服的样子，你甚至感觉到了她身上的热气，“你也要？”她把已经咬出两个窟窿正在流血的爱璃西雅的手腕递给你"}
{"time": 1758380348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336044563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……一个个都在自说自话，我真是……受够了”*于是决定把这些天都积攒的怨气找个有缘人毫无保留地发泄，对还在手中的红色戒指注入魔力，让火焰驱散周围的死雾"}
{"time": 1758380385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368068340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（骰）"}
{"time": 1758380387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "11141437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可...可..”差点说出了这句话，狠狠在心里谴责了这样的自己“不用了...你喝的差不多就不要吸艾璃西雅姐姐了....”"}
{"time": 1758380485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "158861635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*争取时间对左眼注入魔力“卡珊德拉……我给你四分之一……帮我杀了她”"}
{"time": 1758380491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728350425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd100"}
