{"time": 1758381114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801999913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=11141437]\"那就算了。\"她翻个白眼，放下爱璃西雅的手腕，\"勉勉强强。\"随后打了个哈欠，\"我要睡觉了。\""}
{"time": 1758381664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335920366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...斑比酱和我睡一起吗”"}
{"time": 1758382722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "282557436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1336044563]火焰点燃...但却被某种力量所压制，\"虽然我不讨厌会反抗的小猫，不过...\"雾气涌向你的左眼，\"你似乎有危险的玩具呢...我们不是可以轻轻松松谈一谈条件?反正和魔族合作，对于人类来说习以为常吧？\""}
{"time": 1758383498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956179216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1335920366]\"不要，你是我的仆人，哪来主人和仆人睡在一起的道理?\"她嫌恶地拍开你，扫了一眼周围，\"我自己睡。\""}
{"time": 1758383522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "638512229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“明明刚刚你还很友善...”"}
{"time": 1758383823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10780673", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那晚安了...”撇着嘴"}
{"time": 1758383829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1518805767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=10780673]\"现在你是我的人了，怎么？要违逆主人吗？\"她瞪着你，\"害我花了好多血，都怪你。\""}
{"time": 1758383877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625231556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起对不起，我错了，斑比酱，你早点休息吧，晚安”不知道为什么，感觉心里对她有一种畏惧感"}
{"time": 1758384333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208575909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=625231556]\"睡在这里不舒服。\"她的眼睛看向你，\"血啦，棺材啦，有没有?两个都有的最好。\""}
{"time": 1758384361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413472643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉得去找龙神（）"}
{"time": 1758384383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "566787600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=282557436]“作为魔族来说，你的交易精神也算恶劣，我没有和你交易的兴趣”"}
{"time": 1758384389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2086350583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？这种地方怎么会有这种东西，等会我帮你问问诺亚吧...”"}
