{"time": 1758474376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008299411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=248003705]\"没用的东西。\"她斥了你一句，\"我不教，拿了我这么点血，要是这都做不到，找个地方撞死吧\""}
{"time": 1758474426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1421832899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉有点不爽，但什么也不敢说，只能低头认错，然后再次尝试变形..."}
{"time": 1758474465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096891737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=684995543]\"看不出来诶?\"声音带着些惊讶，\"你的灵魂哪里值钱了？\""}
{"time": 1758474672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "55027847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1421832899]总归是....哪哪都不对，试了好几次，始终没成功"}
{"time": 1758474708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93126806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "怎么会....为什么总是失败"}
{"time": 1758474750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1825208136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱，教教我么...要不我以后怎么给你找血喝”"}
{"time": 1758475005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479056609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1096891737]“哦，是吗？这就是你讲价的方式？既然无用，何必在这浪费时间，下面有你更感兴趣的人吧”"}
{"time": 1758475350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1967485675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1825208136]\"冲突吗？\"她的眼睛眯起来，你感觉到危险"}
{"time": 1758475394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "311147996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我这样出去在路上就直接被打死了...”委屈的说道"}
{"time": 1758475599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848612986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=479056609]\"谁?不重要啦，我只是，想尝一尝你的味道。这么任性可不好。\""}
{"time": 1758475682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507521417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=311147996]\"你好烦啊。\"你看到她的胸腔起伏，头发有些炸毛，妖艳的红光从眼瞳中散出，尖牙和指甲跃跃欲试"}
{"time": 1758475718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428525550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "乖乖闭嘴，不敢说话了，捂住自己的嘴"}
{"time": 1758475835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549374828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她瞪了你一眼以示警告，\"别待在我这，出去出去。\""}
{"time": 1758475869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328249209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "牵着艾璃西雅和西莉丝姐姐的手一起出去"}
{"time": 1758475930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004389538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1848612986]“别想了，你要不直接把我捅死……我不会答应的”"}
{"time": 1758476024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2142331296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2004389538]\"你这人没什么一定要实现的愿望吗？\"影子盘旋着...随后不再盘旋，而是朝着你的身体袭来"}
{"time": 1758476171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128491458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1328249209]关上门，那种若有若无的压迫消失，你不由得吐出口气"}
{"time": 1758476330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1056247933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2142331296]“就是因为有……才不能把灵魂随便给你，你这……不懂得珍惜的畜牲！”*尽管无用，但是伸手试图抵挡"}
{"time": 1758476360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065548581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拍了拍自己的胸膛“好可怕...明明之前还觉得斑比酱可可爱爱的，忽然感觉好吓人”"}
{"time": 1758476381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "647379041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，艾璃西雅姐姐 你有感觉什么不适吗”"}
{"time": 1758476664, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826041343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=647379041]\"呃...我?\"此时爱璃西雅似乎才回过神，脸上的红晕仍未褪去，\"我还好啦...\""}
{"time": 1758476833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363054453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真的吗...那我也..”扇扇自己的嘴，试图赶出自己脑子里的邪恶想法“没事就好，没事就好..”"}
{"time": 1758476921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080947066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1056247933]阴影即将入侵你的身体，突然门被从外面推开，伴随着光一起，\"怎么不开灯?总不是刚好了腿，又想去溜达溜达吧？\"熟悉的让人生厌的粉毛声音，阴影在瞬息消散，仿佛刚刚的一切都不存在"}
{"time": 1758477297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829192611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=363054453]\"嗯...\"她疑惑地看了你一眼，\"怎么了？"}
{"time": 1758477336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1492735326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没什么，没什么”擦擦嘴角的口水“我只是在想，为什么我变不成小蝙蝠呢”"}
{"time": 1758477423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480406575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1080947066]“……”*不知道为什么很难高兴得起来“啧，跑得真快……灯不是我关的”"}
{"time": 1758477646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1365119544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1480406575]\"喏，你点的牛排。\"她开了灯，端着一个盘子走进来，\"趁热。\"随后坐在一边的沙发上，低头看起自己的机械球的屏幕"}
{"time": 1758477665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655178116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1492735326]\"也许...没掌握方法?呃...\""}
