{"time": 1758504678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "423848801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我的对手会空间隔断，会摄魂夺魄，会群体精神控制，而我的绝活是给自己剌一刀去糊人眼睛）"}
{"time": 1758504869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "281923604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么感觉诺亚忽然和我变的好生分...”"}
{"time": 1758505067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037475838", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=281923604]\"...\"对这个问题没有回答，\"我为确认现状而来，请见谅。\""}
{"time": 1758505112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "991931420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=201512448]“谢谢谢谢，没有你我都快忘了我在这城里还有盟友了”*用眼神剐她一刀，泄愤般用餐刀切过肉排，在瓷碟上擦得呲呲响“我说你们找错人了，我不是干大事的料”"}
{"time": 1758505163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1486249873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“为了拯救同伴使用了隐藏的力量...大概就是这么回事吧”"}
{"time": 1758505358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1302760953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=991931420]\"我想也是，不过我确实可能过分了点。连人偶小姐都要骂我。\"她站起身，在你面前的餐盘上放下一个小盒子，\"不开心就吃一颗，糖。\""}
{"time": 1758505380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946524914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1486249873]\"...和昨晚看到的时候不一样，发生了什么。\""}
{"time": 1758505411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302458119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，进化了？”"}
{"time": 1758506102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1556986732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=302458119]\"进化...?\"她盯着你的脑袋看了一会，随后摇摇头，\"失陪了。\""}
{"time": 1758506120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39884021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*鼻子有点酸，于是把头低得更低“……城里的势力越来越多了。一会，我去找一趟艾丽西亚，让她给你看看画框里的人到底长什么样……到时候你少说几句，关于收敛办事处，我们没更多线索了”"}
{"time": 1758506190, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1887853696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧...那再见了”看到诺亚的态度还是有一点点伤心的"}
{"time": 1758506315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323644667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=39884021]\"不用了，当时我就知道是谁了。\"她叹了口气，重新坐下，\"有人的真身你一直没见过吧？\"她拨动了一下屏幕，球上显现出白发的异色瞳少女，\"喏。\""}
{"time": 1758506481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631748305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1887853696]她哒哒哒地走了，你们留在原地。"}
{"time": 1758506673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156937202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=323644667]“卡珊德拉么？”*抬起头来看一眼"}
{"time": 1758506981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1536222423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1156937202]\"没错，所谓真实的继承者。\"她低头看着屏幕，\"那个所谓的办事处，从一开始大概就是锚点。\""}
{"time": 1758507023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1783171303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐，现在怎么办”"}
{"time": 1758507098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329521938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“所以那画框是什么？照妖镜？”*回忆一番“还是说，是针对叛徒的火刑架？”"}
{"time": 1758507222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229329007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1783171303]\"只能在这边找个房间等到晚上了。\"她看上去暂时也没什么主意。"}
{"time": 1758507382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353753304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=329521938]\"嗯...\"她考虑了一会，\"可能是，你被拉到这个地方的原因...说是照妖镜，不如说，是存留的影像吗？\""}
{"time": 1758507490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2017266751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起...”感觉有点抱歉"}
{"time": 1758507696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067907886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“原来是狱友，可惜她本人现在晕了”*磨蹭半天，终于吃上一口肉“直接把那地方拆了能管用么”"}
{"time": 1758507790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656153700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1067907886]\"能做到这种事情，不觉得就好像茧一样吗？\"牛排被烘焙地很好，七分熟，入口绵密，洒着不知名的香料。"}
{"time": 1758507805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "427589652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好想出门啊...”摇摇头“算了，现在出去纯纯的找麻烦”"}
{"time": 1758507818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696052337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（像在哪）"}
{"time": 1758508087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984793484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=656153700]“……像在哪？”*这种完全跟不上的感觉多少有点让人焦躁“而且和她有渊源的人是不是太多了点”"}
{"time": 1758508160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1963134407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1984793484]\"好啦，我只是这么说，因为你想，我们要找的是蜘蛛吧？嗯...联想一下联想一下。不过...如果能找到，类似于这样的设施存在的话。\"她在屏幕上点点，\"也许就可以下真正的判断了。\""}
{"time": 1758508175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336953500", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是蜘蛛网）"}
{"time": 1758508234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446787663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（国土炼成这块）"}
{"time": 1758508247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735522315", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我怎么依稀记得）"}
{"time": 1758508270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858670960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我让人找过，突然出现的，来历不明的，没人知道有啥用的建筑）"}
{"time": 1758508313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396165023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那家伙在当什么继承者之前，毕竟是马纳利亚的学生会会长吧？\"柯艾特摇头，\"这里算是她的大本营吗？说不定。\""}
{"time": 1758508729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549837327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果人人喊打也算大本营的话”*嘴里嚼着肉，含混不清“不过类似的建筑我拜托人找过。结果是那个人后来看着我在他的辖区里丢了条腿”"}
{"time": 1758508774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830353654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“天色好像也不早了，要不先去休息吧...”"}
{"time": 1758509008, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1411237235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=549837327]\"...\"她低头看了一眼你的脚，\"今晚大概就能恢复，明天一起过去?我破例不收费帮你找回公道。\""}
{"time": 1758509321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2052825017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那我的谢谢会在明天晚上再说。对方是泰坦，你有把握？”"}
{"time": 1758509540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "914364898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1830353654]\"诺诺今天应该也很困了吧，先休息吧？\""}
{"time": 1758510066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1593710832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2052825017]\"你以为我是何人?哦...\"她起身，\"不要指望我道歉哦，我这个人就这样。\"她看了一眼门口，\"走了。\""}
{"time": 1758510068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "255317220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”"}
{"time": 1758510105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1637088776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“晚安，西莉丝姐姐，艾璃西雅姐姐”"}
{"time": 1758510180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105536987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了”凑到西莉丝的耳边小声说“晚上我可以和西莉丝姐姐睡一起吗..”"}
{"time": 1758510446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2039019651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*没话说，等她走出了门，就把那个小盒子打开看看"}
{"time": 1758510788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1054035941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1105536987]\"...只限今天。\"她似乎有些无可奈何，扫了你一眼，回答完扭开视线"}
{"time": 1758510819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1088980720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好耶，西莉丝姐姐真好”抱着她的胳膊"}
{"time": 1758510845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072905890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2039019651]里面整整齐齐地码着粉红色的软糖，表面撒着糖霜，看上去就很甜。"}
{"time": 1758510906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648849287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*看看左眼还能不能使？"}
{"time": 1758511037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954098976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1648849287]内部蕴含有一些魔力的样子，在你的视野里呈现出蓝光。大概是有炼金的参与。"}
{"time": 1758511128, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309310390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1088980720]“好啦..”她摸了摸你的脑袋，“这个情况，你得去和龙芙小姐说明才行。”"}
{"time": 1758511170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302510234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“斑比酱的事情吗...但是龙芙小姐在哪呢，会不会不想见我”"}
{"time": 1758511188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1487869050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（龙芙不是之前才说别去烦她）"}
{"time": 1758511195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1598252256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（对啊）"}
{"time": 1758511261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "758576091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1954098976]*想了想，至少她的造物还是不马虎的，捡出一粒，但是就这么一小粒也只咬一半先"}
{"time": 1758511341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685218202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=302510234]“...为什么？”西里斯看上去有些疑惑，“...”随后她反应过来，“那就得赔礼道歉才行。”叹口气"}
{"time": 1758511437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1916770862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“西莉丝姐姐可以陪我一起去吗..”"}
{"time": 1758511722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140621518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=758576091]入口即是一股毫不意外的甜，甚至可以说有些过分。不过仅仅吃下一点，身体各处就变得更加通畅，似乎格外有力气。（力敏鉴定+1）思维也较之平常变得敏捷了一些。（灵感+1）"}
