{"time": 1758512106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704058680", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（分我点（bushi）"}
{"time": 1758512137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580724506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1916770862]“首先要能联系上她才行。”她扶着额头"}
{"time": 1758512164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546966487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，刚刚应该直接和诺亚说的来着，我们去找找诺亚吧”"}
{"time": 1758512194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1346990648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=550405268]大约吃了一半的时候，房门被敲响。诺亚的声音从门后传来，“我回来了，能进来吗？”"}
{"time": 1758512253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818054720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她刚刚是不是上楼了？”"}
{"time": 1758512338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453837987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（那你直接动就行）"}
{"time": 1758512340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723232912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1346990648]“当然”*这么应着"}
{"time": 1758512396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "683323849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "尝试上楼，看看五楼能不能上"}
{"time": 1758512579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "152040380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=723232912]（我去你们家呆两天吧（）"}
{"time": 1758512588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530078385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（呆不下（）"}
{"time": 1758512597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1159277885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（猜到你要来广州）"}
