{"time": 1758512678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807770175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(很神必)"}
{"time": 1758512693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685682692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哎，好吧）"}
{"time": 1758512701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "946756200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我另觅他处吧）"}
{"time": 1758512793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886226776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=723232912]她端着盘子进来，上面摆着热牛奶和几块点心，几乎都是巧克力制品，\"刚刚...有发生什么不愉快的事吗？\""}
{"time": 1758512833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813905988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=683323849]此刻显然没有路可以上去，不过也许可以想想其他办法，或者先不管。"}
{"time": 1758513333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1421017799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=886226776]“还行，比更之前好”*目光跟着她一起进来“这些是，我的吗？”"}
{"time": 1758513585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "900816553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1421017799]\"嗯...\"她把餐盘放在桌上，\"要多补充能量吧？而且...担心伊芙小姐会口渴。\"她检查了一下室内，\"没出事就好。\""}
{"time": 1758513605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "812915277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么办...要不我飞上去？但是可能会让龙芙小姐更生气吧”"}
{"time": 1758513700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "646449051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢谢，也不能算没有，不过想那个也没用”*摇了摇头，先加快速度把肉排吃完“现在还没事，谢谢”*又说了一遍谢谢"}
{"time": 1758514027, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584940014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=812915277]“...你要是这么上去，我可不保证会发生什么。”"}
{"time": 1758514089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1360080393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，还是等下次见到诺亚吧”"}
{"time": 1758514111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1551488289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=646449051]“...介意说一说吗？”她的眼眸看向你，“不用和我道谢的...我应该做的。”"}
{"time": 1758514265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118934044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1551488289]“不介意，但是没必要。相比而言说谢谢更有必要”*摇摇头，端起牛奶喝一口“不过能摸进夏日酒店的人……魔，比我想象的多”"}
{"time": 1758514307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964519548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“先去休息吧...”"}
{"time": 1758514363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "120525207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=118934044]“...魔？”她的眼瞳睁大了一些，起身在房间里四处搜寻，“酒店里还混进来了魔族吗？”语气有些激烈，“没有伤到伊芙小姐吧？”"}
{"time": 1758514378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589637856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "果然现在最重要的事情是和西莉丝姐姐一起睡觉"}
{"time": 1758514396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2105605801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1964519548]有些催促似的说道"}
{"time": 1758514542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487955563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=120525207]“似乎还是无实体的类别，很难找的……我没事的，不管有心无心，总之科艾特解了围”*有些无奈“不知道龙芙小姐知不知道这事”"}
{"time": 1758514629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1975422684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2105605801]“好吧好吧...”她摇摇头，“我再去开一间房间，诺诺在这里等一等？”"}
{"time": 1758514788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1911931559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=487955563]“龙芙小姐...”你注意到她的一只眼瞳变为了无神的状态，过了一会又变了回来，“她现在不在酒店。”随后诺亚带着歉意，微微弯腰对你开口，“对不起，伊芙小姐...在酒店里遇险...我们可以提供赔偿...”"}
{"time": 1758514794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1350028312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我....”算了，自己这个形态下去的话，被发现肯定会给西莉丝姐姐添麻烦....“嗯,我会乖乖在这里等着的...”"}
{"time": 1758514995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197560645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1911931559]“喔，这些不是吗？”*指了指桌上的甜品“比起赔偿，我倒是只希望能被发现就好了……我一会打算下楼去找下艾丽西娅，那麻烦你带我下去吗？”"}
{"time": 1758515032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876257663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1350028312]说完她就离开了。走廊上一时变得安静，只剩你和爱璃西雅的呼吸声。"}
{"time": 1758515184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371386434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1197560645]“嗯...这些是我的意思...”她说完自觉失言闭了嘴，“对不起....诶...可以...”她斟酌了一下，“诺维拉小姐，嗯....外形上有了一些变化...”"}
{"time": 1758515329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1938601799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=371386434]“喔……”*心说我知道“我知道她也不像一般人……只有外形变化了吗？”"}
{"time": 1758515535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681288744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1938601799]\"气质上...比之前那个样子好了很多...看上去可以沟通。\"她一边想着一边开口，\"不过...角和翅膀没了...多了一对蝙蝠翅膀。\""}
{"time": 1758515616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618674769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1876257663](没什么想说的话，就先wait a minute)"}
{"time": 1758515631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267789642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”*点了点头“先下去吧，西里斯小姐在的话，应该没问题……”"}
{"time": 1758516094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619595955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=267789642]她点点头，\"嗯...不过伊芙小姐...\"指着蛋糕，\"吃不下了吗...我是不是拿多了...\"语气颇有些自责"}
{"time": 1758516245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726954047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1619595955]“一会上来还可以继续吃嘛，现在刚吃完正餐。我也没试过一次性吃这么多……一会诺亚也分担一点？”"}
{"time": 1758516366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "60422011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...嗯...\"她走上前，有些犹豫是抱还是扶或者背，在你面前纠结着"}
{"time": 1758516490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564835262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“和先前那样就可以”*对着她伸出手"}
{"time": 1758516601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1626313885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=564835262]她稍微松了口气，弯下腰把你抱起来，\"嗯...既然酒店也会被入侵...我之后需要一直待在这里吗？嗯...我的意思是，伊芙小姐准许...吗？\""}
{"time": 1758516766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "949950108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然”*有些暗喜“为什么不呢？我当然相信你”"}
{"time": 1758516825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1157253498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，艾璃西雅姐姐，你之后有和朋友说开吗”"}
{"time": 1758517034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133392375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1157253498]\"啊...这个时候...\"她立刻有些垂头丧气，\"没...没办法的啦...\""}
{"time": 1758517075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804078068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=949950108]“诺亚……各种方面来说，都很好”"}
{"time": 1758517397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1269816137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=804078068]\"啊...\"她抱着你出门，\"诺亚只是人偶...不值得的。\"随后又快速补充，\"这是我应该做的分内之事，理所应当的。\""}
{"time": 1758517525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960707643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哪有，这不是挺人模人样的？”*闭上眼睛克制住嘴角“毕竟，我没有下要点心的指令吧？”"}
{"time": 1758518083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "122428265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=960707643]\"...赔偿...赔偿了那是...\"她说这话终究有些底气不足，语速依然很快，\"...呃，家具人偶的条例是这么写的，所以所以...伊芙不用觉得我很特殊啦...\""}
