{"time": 1758568751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648828907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=475414575]\"哦...\"她眨了眨眼，\"人类果然很复杂啊...\"随后点点头，\"看来我要学的还有很多。\""}
{"time": 1758568783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148600264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=422219327]\"好啦好啦。\"西里斯走在前面，带着你们进了旁边一个套房，和之前一样是双房加一个客厅的搭配。"}
{"time": 1758568819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1976059467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“艾璃西雅姐姐，晚上我们睡一起吧...”跑到艾璃西雅身旁"}
{"time": 1758569054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871660969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1648828907]“其实我不算典型人类……嘛，没差。说是这么说，现在也没什么办法……西里斯多半也不会坐视不管”"}
