{"time": 1758648548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1127771012", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "洗澡的时候继续尝试去变形"}
{"time": 1758648731, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1700357263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(?)"}
{"time": 1758648798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844260624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我先去洗个澡，艾璃西雅姐姐...”今天一天经历的战斗有点多，身上好多汗，血迹倒是都被自己吸收了"}
{"time": 1758649191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1739599015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "进入浴室，脱掉那件西莉丝姐姐送自己的衣服，看到衣服上之前为了让翅膀出来而撕裂的创口，感觉有点伤心...这应该算西莉丝姐姐送给自己的第一件礼物，自己居然..要想办法修复一下，把衣服先放在一旁"}
{"time": 1758649345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "315468940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的，你接着洗，洗完了应该就停了)"}
{"time": 1758649352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1783872489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(龙哥已经，不省人事了)"}
{"time": 1758649357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138629272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1758649493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929832445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "随着水流的在身体上不断的冲刷，感觉一下自己脱胎换骨的新的身体，摸一摸自己之前翅膀的地方“我的翅膀呢？”也许只是收起来了？尝试让翅膀出来"}
{"time": 1758649575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463110414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你的尝试宣告失败，那对翅膀已经完全不见踪影"}
{"time": 1758649719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1567089986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我还挺喜欢的来着...”摇摇头，算了，要不再试试变蝙蝠吧，也许是自己常态力量太弱了？放一点血，试图强化自己，看能不能成功"}
{"time": 1758649786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878490627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那你过你的灵感)"}
