{"time": 1758737581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "221365258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "你被人偶擒在手里，这是爱璃西雅才注意到，\"嗯...?抓到什么了...蝙蝠?\"瞪大眼睛"}
{"time": 1758737614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1298138619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“放开我..是我啦，我是诺诺，艾璃西雅姐姐....”"}
{"time": 1758737617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121618539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2128855502]“还挺有效的嘛……”*一脚深一脚浅，尽管如此还是尽量少让左腿受力，半蹦跳着往浴室去“看~我快好了哦？”"}
{"time": 1758737677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560459609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有点想变回去，但自己好像没穿衣服，还是算了..."}
{"time": 1758737684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848769629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=121618539]诺亚适时扶住你，\"这种时候就不要剧烈运动了。\"随后推开浴室门，陶瓷的浴缸里已经盛好了热水"}
{"time": 1758737775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315924377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1298138619]\"诺诺?\"她连忙慌慌张张地让人偶放开你，随后揪起你的后颈，你在她蓝色的瞳孔里看见了自己，很胖的蝙蝠"}
{"time": 1758737815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434844688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？我怎么这么胖...明明平常吃的也不多”"}
{"time": 1758737842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "390593015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1848769629]\"之后我会在门外等着...客人有事可以呼叫我。\"显得公事公办"}
