{"time": 1758787406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1591908508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1758787503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1995218017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=34053867]“嗯……谢啦。在这城里恐怕也没别的人会和你一样这么想了”"}
{"time": 1758787717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143706111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=614855522]大约过了半小时，她才有了动作...抬起另一只手揉了揉自己的眼睛，\"啊...\"打哈欠"}
{"time": 1758787755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634336702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起啊，艾璃西雅姐姐，昨晚跟你抢被子”有些愧疚"}
{"time": 1758787758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524123782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1995218017]\"嗯...\"她似乎想问什么，不过最后还是没说出口，\"今天是不是要出门?\""}
{"time": 1758787842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301887786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，也不急这一会……早饭过后吧”"}
{"time": 1758787960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519643673", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1634336702]\"啊...\"她看上去没完全醒，发出了一些呓语，\"没...没关系...\"揉着揉着不动了"}
{"time": 1758788070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412741570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“唔..姐姐你再睡会吧”去洗漱了"}
{"time": 1758788203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742789026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1301887786]\"早餐想吃什...\"说着话，柯艾特推开门走进厅堂，她还是一如既往，嘴角挂着笑，不过此刻在一边打着哈欠，\"早上好。\""}
{"time": 1758788236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952438050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1412741570]没什么特别的"}
