{"time": 1758952343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885730490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1343290336]\"真的么.....\"她略显担忧地看着你，拿起你的手臂，\"这都已经红了，不要勉强自己。\""}
{"time": 1758952415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757388065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=983238781]\"看到了一些有趣的事，不是吗？\"身旁的面具女子略有些好笑地开口，不过透过面具声音有些闷"}
{"time": 1758952453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "831683280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她明明披个斗篷不就好了”*嘴角有些抽搐"}
{"time": 1758952511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809169773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=885730490][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “穿长袖就好了...而且只是看起来很严重就是了...”"}
{"time": 1758952735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642021890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=809169773]灼痛不会习惯，只会一直累积，越来越严重。阳光对你的影响无疑是极大的，继续这么暴露下去，表层的皮肤是别想要了"}
{"time": 1758952772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "206863995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等下我...”去换一身比较严实的衣服"}
{"time": 1758953142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107968083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在晒晒阳光看看什么情况.."}
{"time": 1758953193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190613310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(我说我觉得我自愈能力极强，皮肤重新长就好了)"}
