{"time": 1758954344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1486171107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1078986870]\"....\"她微微摇头，\"既然你坚持...那就走吧。\"她转过身，\"伊芙小姐，让你久等了。\""}
{"time": 1758954366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800457559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯..”开心的跟在西莉丝身后"}
{"time": 1758954413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "158881635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没事，不差这会”*点点头“走吧”"}
